## Delete detector
Introduced 1.0
{: .label .label-purple }

Deletes a detector based on the `detector_id`.
To delete a detector, you need to first stop both real-time detection and historical analysis.

#### Example request

```json
DELETE _plugins/_anomaly_detection/detectors/{detectorId}
```

#### Example response

