  <summary>
    Response
  </summary>
  {: .text-delta}

```json
{
  "my_pipeline" : {
    "request_processors" : [
      {
        "filter_query" : {
          "tag" : "tag1",
          "description" : "This processor is going to restrict to publicly visible documents",
