To remove the default pipeline from an index, set it to `null` or `_none`:

```json
PUT /my_index/_settings 
{
  "index.search.default_pipeline" : null
}
```
{% include copy-curl.html %}

```json
PUT /my_index/_settings 
{
  "index.search.default_pipeline" : "_none"
}
```
