}
```

The result is empty:

```json
{
  "took" : 1,
  "timed_out" : false,
  "_shards" : {
    "total" : 1,
    "successful" : 1,
    "skipped" : 0,
    "failed" : 0
  },
  "hits" : {
    "total" : {
      "value" : 0,
      "relation" : "eq"
    },
    "max_score" : null,
    "hits" : [ ]
  }
}
```

For more information, see the [`search_as_you_type` field type documentation]({{site.url}}{{site.baseurl}}/opensearch/supported-field-types/search-as-you-type/).

